  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u95d99939\" id=\"u95d99939\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u714be928\" id=\"u714be928\">官方介绍：</span></strong></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"bookmarklink\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22card%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdoc.zh-jieli.com%2FAC79%2Fzh-cn%2Fmaster%2Fmodule_example%2Fsystem%2Finit_call.html%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdoc.zh-jieli.com%2FAC79%2Fzh-cn%2Fmaster%2Fmodule_example%2Fsystem%2Finit_call.html%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdoc.zh-jieli.com%2Ffavicon.ico%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdoc.zh-jieli.com%2FAC79%2Fzh-cn%2Fmaster%2F_images%2Fimage052.png%22%2C%22title%22%3A%227.7.%20INIT_CALL%20%E2%80%94%20JL%20Project%20Documentation%22%2C%22belong%22%3Anull%2C%22belong_url%22%3Anull%2C%22desc%22%3Anull%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdoc.zh-jieli.com%2FAC79%2Fzh-cn%2Fmaster%2Fmodule_example%2Fsystem%2Finit_call.html%22%2C%22extra%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22_serializer%22%3A%22web.editor_link_detail%22%7D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sh2ai%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7c975751\" id=\"u7c975751\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1a05c1d\" id=\"ub1a05c1d\">late_initcall 宏定义及其工作原理：</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"wobnR\" id=\"wobnR\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92ea1f7f\" id=\"u92ea1f7f\">SEC_USED 宏定义详解:</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20SEC_USED(x)%20__attribute__((section(%23x)%2Cused))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZKBbb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u1ac4d945\"><li fid=\"uec9c78bd\" data-lake-id=\"u4dd85eaa\" id=\"u4dd85eaa\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2a629b96\" id=\"u2a629b96\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00b57638\" id=\"u00b57638\">#define</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uae32a176\" id=\"uae32a176\">：预处理器指令，用于定义宏。</span></li><li fid=\"uec9c78bd\" data-lake-id=\"ua6c58b04\" id=\"ua6c58b04\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub9971d34\" id=\"ub9971d34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a9f4560\" id=\"u4a9f4560\">SEC_USED</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6c8cb144\" id=\"u6c8cb144\">：宏名称，用于将函数放置在指定节并标记为已使用。</span></li><li fid=\"uec9c78bd\" data-lake-id=\"u3b342ae7\" id=\"u3b342ae7\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6982b142\" id=\"u6982b142\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9888a920\" id=\"u9888a920\">(x)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6298202e\" id=\"u6298202e\">：宏参数，代表需要指定的目标节名称。</span></li><li fid=\"uec9c78bd\" data-lake-id=\"u31ef12ea\" id=\"u31ef12ea\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7bdf4c30\" id=\"u7bdf4c30\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94a13575\" id=\"u94a13575\">__attribute__</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc971b862\" id=\"uc971b862\">：GCC 编译器提供的属性关键字，用于指定函数的编译属性。</span></li><li fid=\"uec9c78bd\" data-lake-id=\"ub9f49749\" id=\"ub9f49749\"><code data-lake-id=\"u16c7171b\" id=\"u16c7171b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9bbb48d2\" id=\"u9bbb48d2\">((section(#x),used))</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1ebb7e59\" id=\"u1ebb7e59\">：属性列表，包含以下两个属性： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u1ac4d945\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue1571ba5\" data-lake-id=\"u26b2bf07\" id=\"u26b2bf07\"><code data-lake-id=\"uca08bdb7\" id=\"uca08bdb7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc2c26b4\" id=\"ucc2c26b4\">section(#x)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6dc8ace2\" id=\"u6dc8ace2\">：将函数放置在名为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud2ed40ca\" id=\"ud2ed40ca\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6dd64a0\" id=\"ud6dd64a0\">#x</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub36a65a0\" id=\"ub36a65a0\"> 的节(section)中。</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufeb34334\" id=\"ufeb34334\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf557fa9b\" id=\"uf557fa9b\">#x</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0b7c89ca\" id=\"u0b7c89ca\"> 会被宏参数替换为实际的节名称。</span></li><li fid=\"ue1571ba5\" data-lake-id=\"u65384c16\" id=\"u65384c16\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5d653f2c\" id=\"u5d653f2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1087157b\" id=\"u1087157b\">used</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue4468f35\" id=\"ue4468f35\">：指示编译器不要删除未引用的函数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ub5089041\" id=\"ub5089041\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5b455b10\" id=\"u5b455b10\">使用SEC_USED(section_name)展开 SEC_USED 宏后，得到以下代码：</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22__attribute__((section(section_name)%2Cused))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QYGPY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u642fc751\" id=\"u642fc751\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c4de9db\" id=\"u9c4de9db\">其中，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8004f978\" id=\"u8004f978\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua74eb8e1\" id=\"ua74eb8e1\">section_name </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u121baa3a\" id=\"u121baa3a\">是作为宏参数传递的实际节名称。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0a3faa39\" id=\"u0a3faa39\"><span data-lake-id=\"u010d5e1d\" id=\"u010d5e1d\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"I8vHg\" id=\"I8vHg\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4f68b41\" id=\"uf4f68b41\">initcall_t类型定义:</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22typedef%20int%20(*initcall_t)(void)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y4TnO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u2cd8845f\"><li fid=\"u9d988f70\" data-lake-id=\"u2ad4149e\" id=\"u2ad4149e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u82ca8aee\" id=\"u82ca8aee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71bb77c6\" id=\"u71bb77c6\">typedef</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u93b00ed7\" id=\"u93b00ed7\">：关键字，用于定义类型别名。</span></li><li fid=\"u9d988f70\" data-lake-id=\"u940c48fc\" id=\"u940c48fc\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc66ce9f4\" id=\"uc66ce9f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue264e856\" id=\"ue264e856\">int</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uadc3bf2d\" id=\"uadc3bf2d\">：函数返回值类型，为整数。</span></li><li fid=\"u9d988f70\" data-lake-id=\"uc041982e\" id=\"uc041982e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u783b7a34\" id=\"u783b7a34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3129d016\" id=\"u3129d016\">(*initcall_t)(void)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1c402ab4\" id=\"u1c402ab4\">：函数指针类型，指向</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2ad89281\" id=\"u2ad89281\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufced79b0\" id=\"ufced79b0\">initcall_t</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u963f9f40\" id=\"u963f9f40\">类型的函数。</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaf7be499\" id=\"uaf7be499\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19e98fa6\" id=\"u19e98fa6\">initcall_t</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9885ebd0\" id=\"u9885ebd0\">函数的参数为空指针，返回值为整数。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"McPkJ\" id=\"McPkJ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15d2c3e4\" id=\"u15d2c3e4\"> late_initcall 宏定义详解:</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"nzyyM\" id=\"nzyyM\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d8e9676\" id=\"u4d8e9676\">认识宏</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20late_initcall(fn)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ctconst%20initcall_t%20__initcall_%23%23fn%20SEC_USED(.late.initcall)%20%3D%20fn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q5i27%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u1b5df910\"><li fid=\"u996c78f0\" data-lake-id=\"u5a992190\" id=\"u5a992190\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua75ba082\" id=\"ua75ba082\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5678fcf\" id=\"uc5678fcf\">#define</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udfb25736\" id=\"udfb25736\">：预处理器指令，用于定义宏。</span></li><li fid=\"u996c78f0\" data-lake-id=\"u9299c6de\" id=\"u9299c6de\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1991fcb2\" id=\"u1991fcb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31e30c14\" id=\"u31e30c14\">late_initcall</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u092fd2b7\" id=\"u092fd2b7\">：宏名称，用于将函数标记为延迟初始化函数。</span></li><li fid=\"u996c78f0\" data-lake-id=\"ud43a1cac\" id=\"ud43a1cac\"><code data-lake-id=\"u23a462f4\" id=\"u23a462f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64bfd900\" id=\"u64bfd900\">(fn)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3aa3a5ce\" id=\"u3aa3a5ce\">：宏参数，代表要标记为延迟初始化的函数名。</span></li><li fid=\"u996c78f0\" data-lake-id=\"ucf2a87e9\" id=\"ucf2a87e9\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc13b4e88\" id=\"uc13b4e88\"><span data-lake-id=\"u335224ca\" id=\"u335224ca\">const initcall_t __initcall_##fn</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u20418e65\" id=\"u20418e65\">：定义一个名为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6395a37c\" id=\"u6395a37c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u636460b7\" id=\"u636460b7\"> __initcall_##fn</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u156898c4\" id=\"u156898c4\"> 的常量变量，其类型为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u328e87c0\" id=\"u328e87c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a236134\" id=\"u9a236134\">initcall_t</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1cd44dc9\" id=\"u1cd44dc9\">，表示这是一个初始化函数。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u98ff2df7\" id=\"u98ff2df7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u153be46f\" id=\"u153be46f\">##</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5c197d0e\" id=\"u5c197d0e\"> 运算符用于连接宏参数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2f6dc280\" id=\"u2f6dc280\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0fae2d6\" id=\"ud0fae2d6\">fn</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u65c47b72\" id=\"u65c47b72\"> 和前缀 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u94dea396\" id=\"u94dea396\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57a5faf3\" id=\"u57a5faf3\">__initcall_</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uef2c9251\" id=\"uef2c9251\">，确保每个延迟初始化函数都有唯一的名称。</span></li><li fid=\"u996c78f0\" data-lake-id=\"u1fb87c6b\" id=\"u1fb87c6b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u9acd33c9\" id=\"u9acd33c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0efa7c65\" id=\"u0efa7c65\">SEC_USED(.late.initcall)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3cdbbe65\" id=\"u3cdbbe65\">：使用 SEC_USED 宏将变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1519839b\" id=\"u1519839b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua4dc8664\" id=\"ua4dc8664\">__initcall_##fn</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u017d1e83\" id=\"u017d1e83\"> 放置在</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua3401c95\" id=\"ua3401c95\"><span data-lake-id=\"u396a240b\" id=\"u396a240b\"> .late.initcall</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucca91a52\" id=\"ucca91a52\"> 节(section)中。</span></li><li fid=\"u996c78f0\" data-lake-id=\"u69ad3e3b\" id=\"u69ad3e3b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u9fc493fe\" id=\"u9fc493fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u951b68e1\" id=\"u951b68e1\">=</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u96fd34ca\" id=\"u96fd34ca\">：赋值运算符，用于将函数 fn 赋值给变量</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc7830670\" id=\"uc7830670\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5014bf42\" id=\"u5014bf42\"> __initcall_##fn</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u682550c3\" id=\"u682550c3\">。这实际上将函数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9cc464c8\" id=\"u9cc464c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33ffefd5\" id=\"u33ffefd5\">fn</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u075a525c\" id=\"u075a525c\"> 添加到 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u727b2953\" id=\"u727b2953\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb34be37\" id=\"ufb34be37\">.late.initcall</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3c9dfb16\" id=\"u3c9dfb16\">节(section)中，并使其在内核启动的后期阶段执行。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"xABRl\" id=\"xABRl\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72efc4ec\" id=\"u72efc4ec\">展开宏</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u3be11076\" id=\"u3be11076\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef47c86b\" id=\"uef47c86b\">展开 late_initcall 宏后，得到以下代码：</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22const%20initcall_t%20__initcall_my_init_function%20__attribute__((section(.late.initcall)%2Cused))%20%3D%20my_init_function%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ng8DJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uda3c0205\" id=\"uda3c0205\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7aef9e1d\" id=\"u7aef9e1d\">其中，</span><code data-lake-id=\"udf376a7c\" id=\"udf376a7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27cf88a9\" id=\"u27cf88a9\">my_init_function </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3517263f\" id=\"u3517263f\">是作为宏参数传递的实际函数名称。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uce751f94\" id=\"uce751f94\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87dc978a\" id=\"u87dc978a\">其核心是声明了如下函数</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22initcall_t%20__initcall_my_init_function%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ic27d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u25367cef\" id=\"u25367cef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28a4ab23\" id=\"u28a4ab23\">只不过这个函数有一些特殊之处。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8b7eba87\" id=\"u8b7eba87\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b6a1257\" id=\"u3b6a1257\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"KQok4\" id=\"KQok4\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a35c7e1\" id=\"u9a35c7e1\">工作原理及示例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u696ebe15\" id=\"u696ebe15\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc00bb787\" id=\"uc00bb787\">late_initcall 宏的工作原理:</span></strong></p><ol list=\"ua67d118e\"><li fid=\"uc8511f6e\" data-lake-id=\"uc6d2c68b\" id=\"uc6d2c68b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6af75304\" id=\"u6af75304\">为每个要延迟初始化的函数，定义一个唯一的常量变量。</span></li><li fid=\"uc8511f6e\" data-lake-id=\"u5cbb842a\" id=\"u5cbb842a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6cc67638\" id=\"u6cc67638\">使用 SEC_USED 宏将该变量放置在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud6df631f\" id=\"ud6df631f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u141247ee\" id=\"u141247ee\">.late.initcall</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u47fcd10a\" id=\"u47fcd10a\"> 节(section)中。</span></li><li fid=\"uc8511f6e\" data-lake-id=\"ud378f2dd\" id=\"ud378f2dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u281e1c4e\" id=\"u281e1c4e\">将函数赋值给该变量，</span><span data-lake-id=\"u35c3d840\" id=\"u35c3d840\">使其在内核启动的后期阶段执行。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u996c9c86\" id=\"u996c9c86\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua0ab7380\" id=\"ua0ab7380\">使用示例:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22late_initcall(my_init_function)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zSB9o%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub89c8668\" id=\"ub89c8668\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4721c1f0\" id=\"u4721c1f0\">该代码将被展开为以下代码：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22const%20initcall_t%20__initcall_my_init_function%20__attribute__((section(.late.initcall)%2Cused))%20%3D%20my_init_function%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SoGv2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u098a4981\" id=\"u098a4981\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61bcdd9e\" id=\"u61bcdd9e\">这会将函数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uecbb0de7\" id=\"uecbb0de7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufafa85df\" id=\"ufafa85df\">my_init_function</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud0be895b\" id=\"ud0be895b\"> 添加到</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufecdf1a6\" id=\"ufecdf1a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb0799ea\" id=\"ubb0799ea\"> .late.initcall </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uadae17f2\" id=\"uadae17f2\">节中，确保其在内核启动的后期阶段执行。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6172997a\" id=\"u6172997a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u22b852b1\" id=\"u22b852b1\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"unrjm\" id=\"unrjm\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8edeaac\" id=\"uc8edeaac\">内核执行流程</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u3a4f3fe6\" id=\"u3a4f3fe6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4a7c328\" id=\"uc4a7c328\">参见：</span><a href=\"https://doc.zh-jieli.com/AC79/zh-cn/master/module_example/system/init_call.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4f19dfd5\" id=\"u4f19dfd5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25a7927e\" id=\"u25a7927e\">https://doc.zh-jieli.com/AC79/zh-cn/master/module_example/system/init_call.html</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u367d05d4\" id=\"u367d05d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ecd44d7\" id=\"u8ecd44d7\">文件：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7fa6a134\" id=\"u7fa6a134\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f756628\" id=\"u6f756628\">apps\\common\\system\\init.c</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3615835f\" id=\"u3615835f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ced54f4\" id=\"u5ced54f4\">关键函数调用：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub9c5eaa4\" id=\"ub9c5eaa4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0b7fbe1\" id=\"ud0b7fbe1\">__do_initcall(late_initcall);</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22static%20void%20app_task_handler(void%20*p)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20...%5Cn%20%20%20%20__do_initcall(initcall)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20__do_initcall(module_initcall)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20app_core_init()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20__do_initcall(late_initcall)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20app_main()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20...%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20...%5Cn%20%20%20%20os_init()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20task_create(app_task_handler%2C%20NULL%2C%20%5C%22app_core%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20...%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B6%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gmIeV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3b335e26\" id=\"u3b335e26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u355b9a4d\" id=\"u355b9a4d\">文件：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u92220551\" id=\"u92220551\"><span data-lake-id=\"u146c3b1a\" id=\"u146c3b1a\">include_lib\\system\\init.h</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7b479b4b\" id=\"u7b479b4b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u597d46d3\" id=\"u597d46d3\">真实执行的内容：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20__do_initcall(prefix)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ctdo%20%7B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctinitcall_t%20*init%3B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctextern%20initcall_t%20prefix%23%23_begin%5B%5D%2C%20prefix%23%23_end%5B%5D%3B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctfor%20(init%3Dprefix%23%23_begin%3B%20init%3Cprefix%23%23_end%3B%20init%2B%2B)%20%7B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ct(*init)()%3B%5Ct%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%7D%20%5C%5C%5Cn%5Ct%7Dwhile(0)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qlg8q%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u52907fb5\" id=\"u52907fb5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51326244\" id=\"u51326244\">通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2c471068\" id=\"u2c471068\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d216f7b\" id=\"u0d216f7b\">__do_initcall(late_initcall);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7135de00\" id=\"u7135de00\">展开后：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22do%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20initcall_t%20*init%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20extern%20initcall_t%20late_initcall_begin%5B%5D%2C%20late_initcall_end%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20(init%20%3D%20late_initcall_begin%3B%20init%20%3C%20late_initcall_end%3B%20init%2B%2B)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20(*init)()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%20while%20(0)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B4%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dpnHs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0458a6e9\" id=\"u0458a6e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7cdeb84\" id=\"ue7cdeb84\">即通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubee3b561\" id=\"ubee3b561\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub447b95b\" id=\"ub447b95b\">(*init)();</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u99258ba4\" id=\"u99258ba4\">调用每一个通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u041b64ab\" id=\"u041b64ab\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5c4fb8a\" id=\"ue5c4fb8a\">late_initcall(my_init_function);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u00ed4d36\" id=\"u00ed4d36\">方式注册的函数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucaecd281\" id=\"ucaecd281\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7a6f647\" id=\"ua7a6f647\">这里的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2eb5ad85\" id=\"u2eb5ad85\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4601b01\" id=\"ue4601b01\">(*init)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaa3de111\" id=\"uaa3de111\">代表了</span><code data-lake-id=\"udd1e5646\" id=\"udd1e5646\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f0ac4bd\" id=\"u9f0ac4bd\">my_init_function</span></code></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"G4bgE\" id=\"G4bgE\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf13ed921\" id=\"uf13ed921\">总结</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u95337502\" id=\"u95337502\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6444e80e\" id=\"u6444e80e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c5e3d55\" id=\"u9c5e3d55\">late_initcall</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u20951d2f\" id=\"u20951d2f\"> 宏用于将函数标记为延迟初始化函数，这类函数会在内核启动的后期阶段执行。它通过为每个函数定义唯一的常量变量并使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9549890d\" id=\"u9549890d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f3c798c\" id=\"u8f3c798c\">SEC_USED</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uda277019\" id=\"uda277019\"> 宏将其放置在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u923cc382\" id=\"u923cc382\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaebe00d7\" id=\"uaebe00d7\">.late.initcall</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uecf3f273\" id=\"uecf3f273\"> 节(section)中来实现这一功能。</span></p>",
